# Incident Analyzer — Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env` and customize as needed:

```dotenv
# Environment
ENV=development

# Log directories
LOG_DIR=./logs
RESULTS_DIR=./results

# Embeddings — use Ollama for zero API cost
EMBEDDER=ollama:nomic-embed-text
USE_OLLAMA=true
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# Vector database
VECTOR_DB=qdrant
QDRANT_HOST=localhost
QDRANT_PORT=6333

# LLM via PydanticAI (Anthropic model — may incur charges)
LLM_MODEL=anthropic:claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022

# Evaluation
GOLDEN_SET_PATH=./tests/golden_set.jsonl
EVAL_METRICS=groundedness, faithfulness, answer_relevance

# Observability — OpenTelemetry endpoint
# Uncomment and set if using Langfuse or other OTLP exporter
# OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:3000/api/v1/traces
```